cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PRELUDE: Pre-Rendering for Enhanced Listening Under Degraded Encoding"
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open-source toolkit for cochlear implant audio simulation and
  pre-processing research. Provides a stage-by-stage simulator of the
  cochlear implant signal chain — analysis filterbank, envelope
  extraction, n-of-m channel selection, loudness mapping into the
  electrical dynamic range, channel interaction, and resynthesis — with
  the electrodogram exposed as a first-class output. Intended for
  research into pre-processing recorded audio so that more of the
  original survives transmission through an implant.
